  "solution": "Sắp xếp các giá trị trong mẫu số liệu thành một dãy không giảm, ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>105</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>118</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>148</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>157</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>162</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>165</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>170</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>179</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>208</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\tTổng tần số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ hai là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>162</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>165</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>163</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>148</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó khoảng tứ phân vị là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>148</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> là giá trị bất thường nếu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>148</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>115</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>203</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br>Vậy trong mẫu số liệu trên có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> giá trị bất thường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>105</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www